    <string name="look_controls_rebind_help">Give any of Tandem\'s commands another button, a chord of buttons pressed together, or a held button: open, back, the options menu, Start, the quick settings, the game switcher, the side panel, paging, hidden games, and a button for Favourite, Screenshot and Clip. Hints everywhere follow.</string>
