    <string name="look_screens_swap">Swap screens</string>
    <string name="look_screens_swap_help">The library moves to the bottom (touch) screen and the details go on top, instantly. X does this on the icon grid. Games still open on the top screen.</string>
    <string name="look_screens_rotation">Keep auto-rotate off</string>
    <string name="look_screens_rotation_help">The Thor turns auto-rotate back on by itself now and then. Tandem switches it off again whenever you come back. Turn this off to choose yourself.</string>

    <string name="look_reset">Reset look</string>
    <string name="look_reset_help">Back to Tandem\'s original look: theme, layout, wallpapers, icons and motion. Your buttons, screens, sounds and music, library, favourites and play time aren\'t touched.</string>
    <string name="look_reset_ask">Reset the whole look?</string>
    <string name="look_reset_ask_body">Theme, layout, wallpapers, icons and motion go back to how Tandem first looked. Buttons, screens, sound and games stay.</string>
    <string name="look_reset_ask_do">Reset</string>
